{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73df9404c9c890819efccde44ac64db431606d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:N \\to R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"16\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/2/d6287498b806437ee45ca7417cf43a406ffdc7f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)=f(n-1)-f(n-2),\\forall n\\geq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"278\" height=\"18\" />.\nGiven that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8e38a693765b2a79ffdaa1eb3a65e6ca0155fd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=f(2)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/b/aeb39f4da310c9b161f562170c5ce22d95965b01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff3ccebcde611367e25117981c95bc6d008cf489.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 3\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ -3\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 2\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 1\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"364\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Lets write out a couple of terms: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2f0ce04fe7f6a9167f1d2b5da1191f67a9e03e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}f(3)&amp;=f(2)-f(1)=0&amp; f(4)&amp;=f(3)-f(2)=-1\\\\ f(5)&amp;=f(4)-f(3)=-1&amp; f(6)&amp;=f(5)-f(4)=0\\end{align*}\" width=\"420\" height=\"43\" />\nWe quickly see that every third term is zero, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/7/a07e655cd29678d48f0577dc2f5c5d1dda102c12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_21\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/i